      <title>2027年美国房贷利率难降 购房者等待策略或落空</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260831/2027%E5%B9%B4%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E6%88%BF%E8%B4%B7%E5%88%A9%E7%8E%87%E9%9A%BE%E9%99%8D-%E8%B4%AD%E6%88%BF%E8%80%85%E7%AD%89%E5%BE%85%E7%AD%96%E7%95%A5%E6%88%96%E8%90%BD%E7%A9%BA/</link>
